flowchart LR
    C[Client] -->|POST /process| API[API Server<br/>asyncio, rate limiter]
    API --> Q[(Bounded Queue<br/>back-pressure)]
    Q --> W1[Worker 1]
    Q --> W2[Worker 2]
    Q --> WN[Worker N]
    W1 & W2 & WN --> CACHE{TTL-LRU Cache}
    CACHE -- miss --> CB[Circuit Breaker + Retry]
    CB --> S[[Strategy<br/>fast / io / thorough]]
    S -. CPU-bound .-> PP[ProcessPool]
    W1 & W2 & WN --> BUF[Write Buffer<br/>batch N rows]
    BUF --> DB[(SQLite WAL<br/>pooled, indexed)]
    W1 & W2 & WN -- events --> BUS[EventBus<br/>Observer]
    BUS --> M[Metrics Observer]
    M --> PROM[/metrics<br/>Prometheus/]
    PROM --> GRAF[Grafana + Alerts]
